nity at https://discord.gg/mHMhrTCtZS \n\nParty Monsters unleashes a world of thrilling gameplay, featuring:\n\ud83d\udd2b Unique Bullets + Gorilla-like Locomotion \ud83e\udd8d\n\ud83d\udc79 PVE Mode: Slay all kinds of enemies.\n\u2694\ufe0f PVP Mode: Have a go in team-death match to claim your victory.\n\ud83d\udc3e Variety of Enemies\n\ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f Diverse Maps\n\nAnd that's not all! As the game updates, more content will unlock! Please stay tuned.\ud83c\udd95\ud83c\udd95\ud83c\udd95", "short_description": "\ud83d\udee0\ufe0fParty Monsters is currently in its BETA phase. We are tirelessly working to upgrade and polish this game! \n\ud83c\udf89Welcome to our vibrant Discord community at https://discord.gg/mHMhrTCtZS \n\nParty Monsters unleashes a world of thrilling gameplay, featuring:\n\ud83d\udd2b Unique Bullets + Gorilla-like Locomotion\n\ud83d\udc79 PVE Mode: Slay all kinds of enemies.\n\u2694\ufe0f PVP Mode: Have a go in team-death match to claim your victory.\n\ud83d\udc3e Variety of Enemies\n\ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f Diverse Maps\n\nAs the game updates, more content will unlock! \ud83c\udd95"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "http://www.roarwildstudio.com/party_monster/private.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "http://www.roarwildstudio.com/party_monster/user.html", "publisher_name": "Roar Wild Studio", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.roarwildstudio.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "644354873106712"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player